title: "LoRaWAN Resource Allocation and Feedback Evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sarda
    given-names: Keshav
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
repository-code: "https://github.com/NullByte14/lorawan-rl-resource-allocation"
keywords:
  - LoRaWAN
  - reinforcement learning
  - resource allocation
  - delayed feedback
  - reproducible simulation
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python simulation experiments for LoRaWAN spreading-factor and
  transmit-power allocation, delivery-aware state and reward ablations, and
  explicit delayed-feedback airtime and energy accounting. Comparisons distinguish
  reconstructed literature methods, controlled ablations, and adapted baselines.
